program	errors/let_void_expression_rejected.saw
triple	arm64-apple-darwin
twin	same
expect	error
build	refused	cannot bind `n` to an expression of type `Void` — it produces no value
meets_expect	yes
log	"error: cannot bind `n` to an expression of type `Void` — it produces no value"
log	"  --> examples/errors/let_void_expression_rejected.saw:12:5"
log	"     |"
log	" 12 |     let n = nothing()"
log	"     |     ^"
log	"   hint: call it as a statement on its own line, or write `let _ = ...` if the point is to evaluate it and discard"
log	""
log	"1 error(s) generated"
